  "basis": "The visual evidence from the dashboard shows a clear overall increase in screening referrals from 2012 to 2023. The orange line starts at approximately 1,200 in 2012 and ends at approximately 3,300 in 2023, representing a significant upward trend over the reporting period. While the chart title reads 'Reduced Screening Referrals,' the plotted data contradicts this, showing a growth pattern. In the absence of an explicit policy defining the mapping, the most direct interpretation of a 'growth-focused' pathway is that it applies to a referral pattern showing overall growth. Therefore, the visual trend of increasing referrals supports the growth-focused option.",
  "option_label": "Route to growth-focused referral follow-up"
}
